00:31:53,123 --> 00:31:55,623
Oh, shoot!

367
00:31:58,623 --> 00:32:03,623
With you Liz, I'm sure your debut will be wonderful. I'm looking forward to it.
But with you, Liz, I'm sure your debut will be wonderful. I'm looking forward to it.

