371
00:32:36,623 --> 00:32:45,123
So much has happened since we infiltrated Holo. Songs, performances, troubles, challenges, and kind words, too.

372
00:32:46,123 --> 00:32:50,123
All of them are irreplaceable memories I'll cherish forever.

373
00:32:51,123 --> 00:32:59,123
I want to do my best for my family, my friends, my kingdom, and of course, my talented girlies, Justice!

374
00:32:59,623 --> 00:33:03,123
