376
00:33:10,623 --> 00:33:13,623
Whew, it's been such a busy day.

377
00:33:14,123 --> 00:33:17,123
Maybe I should rest for a bit...

378
00:33:17,623 --> 00:33:29,623
Get a little, a little nap wouldn't hurt anybody. I mean... manages as I should nap anyways, so whatever.
Take a little... a little nap wouldn't hurt anybody. I mean... manages as I should nap anyways, so whatever.

379
00:34:02,923 --> 00:34:06,923
顔を合わせれば喧嘩してばかり
Whenever we saw each other all we did was fight.

380
00:34:06,923 --> 00:34:10,623
それもいい思い出だった
But those were also wonderful memories.

381
00:34:10,623 --> 00:34:15,623
きみが教えてくれたんだ もう怖くない
You taught me so much, I'm not scared anymore.

382
00:34:15,623 --> 00:34:21,123
どんな不自由でも 幸せは掴める だから
