563
00:54:00,884 --> 00:54:05,764
Thank you, Bobby! Thank you so much! You're such a good boy!

564
00:54:06,564 --> 00:54:11,384
All right, back to the Duke and the Queen mother you go.

565
00:54:12,964 --> 00:54:18,304
Oh gosh, I honestly can't believe it, time has flown.

566
00:54:19,504 --> 00:54:25,284
